    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96851" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῖφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>body of men in close array</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
