				Hdt.
				9.57
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεῶν στῖφος</span> the <i>close
				array</i> of ships, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				366
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ποιήσασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.70
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεανιῶν ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				852
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pax</u>
				564
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.92
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.4.19
			</span></i>, etc.: pl., <i>masses, groups</i>, <i><span class="en">
